  Discover copy for Android and iOS, one catalogue (the map, the sheet, the legend and its charts).
  Copy rules (docs/screens.md, CopyRulesTest). No em or en dashes, no colons or semicolons. Minimal
  copy, explanations live in info sheets. Compose resources format only %1$s and %1$d, so a literal
  percent sign is a single %.
-->
